Baud rate changes take effect after a restart.␀␀␀The clock is kept through restarts. A GPS module (e.g. u-blox NEO-6M/M8N) with PPS sets it to
within a few ms anywhere, no internet needed. GPS changes take effect after a restart.␀␀␀␀Label = button name. In the text: {CALL} callsign box, {RST} Sent box (599 is sent as 5NN),
